SCOPE OF THE PUBLIC DOMAIN DEDICATION

The dedication in UNLICENSE covers the original code in this repository.

It does not, and cannot, cover third-party material that this project depends
on or interoperates with - the Minecraft client, NeoForge, and any mod whose
blocks, items or APIs are referenced here. Those remain under their own terms.

Compile-time dependencies are resolved from public mavens (createmod.net,
NeoForged, Modrinth) at build time. No third-party jar is committed.


CREATE - CODE MIT, ASSETS ALL RIGHTS RESERVED

Create's licence splits: everything under its src/main/resources/assets/ is
All Rights Reserved, and only the code is MIT. So this mod ships **no copy of
any Create texture or model file**, not even a modified one.

Where the blocks here need to look like Create's, the model JSON references
Create's texture *paths* and Minecraft resolves them at runtime:

  create:block/rotation_speed_controller
  create:block/rotation_speed_controller_top
  create:block/axis
  create:block/axis_top

That is a reference, not a redistribution - nothing is copied into this jar,
and Create is a required dependency in any case, so the paths always resolve.
The Soulstained Shaft's colour is a runtime tint (a colour handler multiplying
Create's grey axis texture), not a recoloured copy of the file.

The geometry in models/block/*.json is authored here from scratch rather than
adapted from Create's model files, which are assets and therefore reserved.


